@baseUrl = http://localhost:8787/api

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "path": "/home/juan"
}

### Project error
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": null,
  "path": "/home/juan"
}

### Project duplicate (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test again",
  "path": "/home/juan"
}
